  "details": "Apple device and iOS version:\n\nIPhone 14 on Version 17.5.1\n\nInstalled VRC Testflight Version and VRC Build Number\n\n2024.2.3 (333) and VRC Build 1472\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\nThe \"Logging\" option in the menu does not stay enabled after closing and reopening VRC unlike on PC, as a note I turned on logging and joined a new instance and it was still on, it's just restarting VRC that turns it off\n\nSteps I took:\n\nOpened the menu, turned on logging, restarted VRC and then checked the logging setting\n\nWhat do you expect to happen?\n\nLogging setting would stay on after restarting VRC\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nLogging turns itself off after restarting VRC",
